{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/5c136d954322bfdacec45c7ebb06ad25.poster.avif?t=1773693288\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/5c136d954322bfdacec45c7ebb06ad25.webm?t=1773693288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/5c136d954322bfdacec45c7ebb06ad25.mp4?t=1773693288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take to the skies in this explosive 3D platformer adventure!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High above the clouds, <strong>Bombun</strong>\u00a0guards her floating fortress from danger. But peace is short-lived. Her former friend, now reengineered and ruthless, returns as <strong>Robombun</strong>, leading an aerial uprising with a mechanized army of drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and blast your way through soaring sky islands and high-tech strongholds. Master precision platforming, use explosive abilities, and face off in bombastic battles against Robombun\u2019s robotic forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outmaneuver the machines and save the skies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/ac445a98433b67e16e58f7524892e0bb.poster.avif?t=1773693288\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/ac445a98433b67e16e58f7524892e0bb.webm?t=1773693288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/ac445a98433b67e16e58f7524892e0bb.mp4?t=1773693288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>3D platforming action.</i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Traverse through 6 floating worlds.</i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stylized visuals and explosive combat mechanics.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/60716325fbd1e9f620963352a59b54ed.avif?t=1773693288\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609320?t=1773693288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/88bf8c427952b405818a6b4eb1775d719eeb8750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773693288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/43abca8034c1944c5e4b17416466b5290428c993/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773693288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/43abca8034c1944c5e4b17416466b5290428c993/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773693288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4398380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared